%YAML 1.2
---
lang: en-US

type: enumeration set

uri: https://gedcom.io/terms/v7/enumset-ADOP

specification:
  - |
    This set has no `OTHER` value, but the `PHRASE` substructure of
    `https://gedcom.io/terms/v7/FAMC-ADOP` may still be used to record the wording
    of the source beside the enumerated value.
    
    <div class="example">
    
    An adoption record that names the adopters as "Mr. and Mrs. Bruce Smith" might
    be
    
    ```gedcom
    1 ADOP
    2 FAMC @F1@
    3 ADOP BOTH
    4 PHRASE Mr. and Mrs. Bruce Smith
    ```
    
    </div>

enumeration values:
  - "https://gedcom.io/terms/v7/enum-ADOP-HUSB"
  - "https://gedcom.io/terms/v7/enum-ADOP-WIFE"
  - "https://gedcom.io/terms/v7/enum-BOTH"

standard: true

contact: "https://gedcom.io/community/"
...
